        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsntplRH2_V9_zWMl1Yk44TD1BaufaZ984prNCTWRJrlxJOSUH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Usually shopping for new insurance is a hassle for me. Talking to DPJL over the weekend was a great decision. Stephanie Lavallee who helped me through the process was amazing. she knew what she was doing, took the time to understand my needs and provide me  the best possible cover. email exchanges were efficient and prompt. I really recommend the DPJL group for all your insurance needs",
        "time": 1714480099,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicholas Maniatis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100202497194167295202/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJu4KB3XzoWRrzZOZxz7XxyBifFyK3E6tK2Fava90ISdUx5iw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Just finished getting off the phone with Brenda and I must say, this woman deserves a big raise. She went above and beyond to help  me get an insurance quote on a vehicle and she was extremely informative. She is very joyous and you can very easily tell she enjoys what she is doing, and I can confidently say DPJL Vaudreuil is very lucky to have someone like her part of their staff. Thank you Brenda!",
        "time": 1708350407,
        "translated": false
      },
